hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Raja' Qutaibah bin Sa'id, 'an Malik bin Anas, 'an Rabi'ah bin Abi 'Abdir Rahman, 'an Anas bin Malik, annahu sami'ahu yaqulu: Kana Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) lais bit-tawil-il-ba'in, wa la bil-qasir, wa la bil-abyad-il-amhaq, wa la bil-adam, wa la bil-ja'd-il-qatat, wa la bis-sabit, ba'athahu Allah ta'ala 'ala ra'si arba'ina sanah, fa aqama bi Makkah 'ashra sinin, wa bil-Madinah 'ashra sinin, wa tawaffahu Allah ta'ala 'ala ra'si sittina sanah, wa lais fi ra'sihi wa lihyatihi 'ishruna sha'ratan bayda."
"2","[AI-translation] Haddasana Humaid bin Mas'adah al-Basri, qala: Haddasana 'Abdul Wahhab ath-Thaqafi, 'an Humaid, 'an Anas bin Malik, qala: Kana Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) rab'ah, lais bit-tawili wa la bil-qasir, hasan-al-jism, wa kana sha'ruhu lais bi-ja'din wa la sabit asmar-al-lawn, idha mashaa yatakaffa'."
"3","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Bishshar, qala: Haddasana Muhammad bin Ja'far, qala: Haddasana Shu'bah, 'an Abi Ishaq, qala: Sami'tul Bara'a bin 'Azib yaqulu: Kana Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) rajulan marbu'an, ba'ida ma bainal mankibain, 'azim-al-jummati ila shahmati udhnaihi al-yusra, 'alaihi hullatun hamra', ma ra'aitu shai'an qat'tu ahsana minhu."
"4","[AI-translation] Haddasana Mahmud bin Ghailan, qala: Haddasana Waki', qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Abi Ishaq, 'anil Bara'i bin 'Azib, qala: Ma ra'aitu min dhi limmatin fi hullatin hamra'a ahsana min Rasulillah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), lahu sha'run yadribu mankibaih, ba'idu ma bainal mankibain, lam yakun bil-qasiri wa la bit-tawil."
"5","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Isma'il, qala: Haddasana Abu Nu'aim, qala: Haddasana al-Mas'udi, 'an 'Uthman bin Muslim bin Hurmuz, 'an Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im, 'an 'Ali bin Abi Talib, qala: Lam yakunin Nabiyyu (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bit-tawili wa la bil-qasir, shathnul kaffaini wal-qadamain, dakhm-ur-ra's, dakhm-ul-karadis, tawil-ul-masrubah, idha mashaa takaffa'a takaffu'an, ka'annama yanhattu min sabab, lam ara qablahu wa la ba'dahu mithlah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', qala: Haddasana abi, 'anil Mas'udi, bi hadhal-isnadi, nahwahu, bi ma'na."
"6","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Isma'il, qala: Haddasana Abu Nu'aim, qala: Haddasana al-Mas'udi, 'an 'Uthman bin Muslim bin Hurmuz, 'an Nafi' bin Jubair bin Mut'im, 'an 'Ali bin Abi Talib, qala: Lam yakunin Nabiyyu (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bit-tawili wa la bil-qasir, shathnul kaffaini wal-qadamain, dakhm-ur-ra's, dakhm-ul-karadis, tawil-ul-masrubah, idha mashaa takaffa'a takaffu'an, ka'annama yanhattu min sabab, lam ara qablahu wa la ba'dahu mithlah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam). Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', qala: Haddasana abi, 'anil Mas'udi, bi hadhal-isnadi, nahwahu, bi ma'na."
"7","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin 'Abdah ad-Dabbi al-Basri, wa 'Ali bin Hujr, wa Abu Ja'far Muhammad bin Al-Husain wa huwa Ibnu Abi Halimah, wal-ma'na wahid, qalu: Haddasana 'Isa bin Yunus, 'an 'Umar bin 'Abdillah mawla Ghufrah, qala: Haddathani Ibrahim bin Muhammad min waladi 'Ali bin Abi Talib, qala: Kana 'Ali idha wasafa Rasulallah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) qala: Lam yakun Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) bit-tawil-il-mumghit, wa la bil-qasir-il-mutaraddid, wa kana rab'atan minal qawm, lam yakun bil-ja'd-il-qatat wa la bis-sabit, kana ja'dan rajila, wa lam yakun bil-mutahhami wa la bil-mukaltham, wa kana fi wajhihi tadwir, abyad mushrab, ad'aj-ul-'ainain, ahdab-ul-ashfar, jalil-ul-mashshi wal-katad, ajrad, dhu masrubah, shathnul kaffaini wal-qadamain, idha mashaa ka'annama yanhattu fi sabab, wa idha talafa talafa ma'an, baina kataifaihi khatam-un-nubuwwah, wa huwa khatam-un-nabiyyin, ajwad-un-naasi sadran, wa asdaq-un-naasi lahjah, wa alyanuhum 'ariqah, wa akramuhum 'ishrah, man ra'ahu badihatan habahu, wa man khalathahu ma'rifatan ahabbahu, yaqulu na'ituhu: Lam ara qablahu wa la ba'dahu mithlahu (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam)."
"8","[AI-translation] Haddasana Sufyan bin Waki', qala: Haddasana Juma' bin 'Umar bin 'Abdir Rahman al-'Ijli, imla'an 'alaina min kitabihi, qala: Akhbarani rajulun min Bani Tamim, min waladi Abi Halah zauji Khadijah, yukanna Abu 'Abdillah, 'an ibnin li Abi Halah, 'anil Hasan bin 'Ali, qala: Sa'altu khali Hind bin Abi Halah, wa kana wassafan, 'an hilyati Rasulillah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), wa ana ashtahi an yasifa li minha shai'an ata'allaqu bihi, fa qala: Kana Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fakhman mufakhkhaman, yatala'u wajhuhu, tala'u-al-qamari lailat-al-badr, atwal minal marbu', wa aqsar minal mushazzab, 'azim-ul-hamah, rajil-ush-sha'ar, ini infaraqat 'iqiqatuhu farraqaha, wa illa fala yujawizu sha'ruhu shahmata udhnaihi idha huwa waffarahu, azhar-ul-lawn, wasi'-ul-jabin, azajj-ul-hawajib, sabigha fi ghairi qarnin, bainahuma 'irqun yudirruhu al-ghadab, aqna-al-'irnin, lahu nurun ya'luhu, yahsabuhu man lam yata'ammalhu ashamma, kathth-ul-lihyah, sahl-ul-khaddain, dali'-ul-fam, mufallaj-ul-asnan, daqiq-ul-masrubah, ka'anna 'unuqahu jidu dumyatin, fi safaa'il-fiddah, mu'tadil-ul-khalq, badin mutamassik, sawa'-ul-batni was-sadr, 'arid-us-sadr, ba'idu ma bainal mankibain, dakhm-ul-karadis, anwar-ul-mutajarad, mawsulu ma bainal libbati was-surrah bi-sha'arin yajri kal-khatt, 'ari-th-thudiyaini wal-batni mimma siwa dhalik, as'ar-ud-dira'aini wal-mankibain, wa a'ali-s-sadr, tawil-uz-zandain, rahb-ur-rahah, shathnul kaffaini wal-qadamain, sa'il-ul-atraf aw qala: sha'il-ul-atraf, khamasan-ul-akhmasain, masih-ul-qadamain, yanbu 'anhuma al-ma', idha zala zala qala'an, yakhutu takaffiya, wa yamshi hawnan, dhari'-ul-mashyah, idha mashaa ka'annama yanhattu min sabab, wa idha talafa talafa jami'an, khafid-ut-tarf, nazaruhu ilal-ard atwalu min nazarhi ilas-sama', jullu nazarhi al-mulahazah, yasuqu ashabahu, wa yabda'u man laqiya bis-salam."
"9","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Musa Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna, haddasana Muhammad bin Ja'far, haddasana Shu'bah, 'an Simak bin Harb, qala: Sami'tu Jabir bin Samurah yaqulu: Kana Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) dali'-al-fam, ashkal-al-'ain, manhus-ul-'aqib."
"10","[AI-translation] Haddasana Hannad bin As-Sarri, qala: Haddasana 'Abthar bin Al-Qasim, 'an Ash'ath ya'ni Ibna Sawwar, 'an Abi Ishaq, 'an Jabir bin Samurah, qala: Ra'aitu Rasulallah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) fi lailatin idhhiyan, wa 'alaihi hullatun hamra', fa ja'altu anzuru ilaihi wa ila al-qamar, fa lahuwa 'indi ahsanu minal qamar."
"11","[AI-translation] Hamain Sufyan bin Waki' ne hadith bayan ki, hamain Humaid bin 'Abdur Rahman Ar-Ru'asi ne hadith bayan ki, Zuhair se, Abi Ishaq se, kehte hain ke: Ek shakhs ne Al-Bara' bin 'Azib se pucha: Kya Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ka chehra talwar jaisa tha? Unhon ne farmaya: Nahi, balki chaand jaisa tha."
"12","[AI-translation] Hamain Abu Dawud Al-Masahifi Sulaiman bin Salm ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamain An-Nadr bin Shumail ne hadith bayan ki, Saleh bin Abi Al-Akhdar se, Ibn Shihab se, Abi Salama se, Abi Huraira se, kehte hain ke: Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) saaf safed thay, goya chandi se ghale hue hain, aur unke baal sidhe thay."
"13","[AI-translation] Hamain Qutaiba bin Sa'id ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Mujhe Al-Laith bin Sa'd ne khabar di, Abi Az-Zubair se, Jabir bin 'Abdullah se, ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe anbiya pesh kiye gaye, pas Musa ('alaihis salam) ek qisam ke mardon mein se thay, goya Shanu'ah ke mardon mein se hain, aur maine 'Isa bin Maryam ('alaihis salam) ko dekha, pas jo maine dekha usmein sab se zyada mushabehah 'Urwa bin Mas'ud tha, aur maine Ibrahim ('alaihis salam) ko dekha, pas jo maine dekha usmein sab se zyada mushabehah tumhara saathi tha, yani apna nafs, aur maine Jibril ('alaihis salam) ko dekha, pas jo maine dekha usmein sab se zyada mushabehah Dihya tha."
"14","[AI-translation] Hamain Sufyan bin Waki' aur Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith bayan ki, ma'na ek hai, dono kahne lage: Hamain Yazid bin Harun ne khabar di, Sa'id Al-Jurairi se, kehte hain ke: Maine Abi Tufail ko kehte suna: Maine Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ko dekha aur zameen par mujhe chod kar koi nahi bacha jo unhe dekh chuka ho. Maine kaha: Mere liye unka halaat bayan karo. Farmaya: Safed, khoobsurat aur qad mein mutawassit thay."
"15","[AI-translation] Hamain 'Abdullah bin 'Abdur Rahman ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamain Ibrahim bin Al-Mundhir Al-Hizami ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamain 'Abdul 'Aziz bin Abi Thabit Az-Zuhri ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Mujhe Isma'il bin Ibrahim, Musa bin 'Uqba ke bhatije ne hadith bayan ki, Musa bin 'Uqba se, Kurayb se, Ibn 'Abbas se, kehte hain ke: Rasoolullah (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) donon samne wale daanton ke darmiyan dhalw wale thay, jab farmate to unke daanton ke darmiyan se noor nikalte hue dikhai deta tha."
"16","[AI-translation] Hamain Abu Raja' Qutaiba bin Sa'id ne hadith bayan ki, kahne lage: Hamain Hatim bin Isma'il ne hadith bayan ki, Al-Ja'd bin 'Abdur Rahman se, kehte hain ke: Maine As-Sa'ib bin Yazid ko kehte suna: Meri khala mujhe Nabi (sallallahu 'alaihi wa sallam) ki taraf le gayi, aur kahne lage: Aye Rasoolullah! Mere bhatije ko dard hai. Unhon ne mere sar par hath phiraaya aur mere liye barkat ki dua ki, aur wuzu kiya, main ne unke wuzu ke pani se pi liya, aur unke peeth ke piche khada hua, aur unke dono kandhon ke darmiyan khatam ko dekha, pas wo kheme ke pip jaisa tha."
